{"id":"n81453-1-9","stage":5,"title":"탄식 · 叹息","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81453-1-9-1","ko":"오늘 경기에서는 우리 축구팀이 너무 못했어.","zh":"今天的比赛中，我们足球队表现实在太差了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"경기에서는","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기에서는","audio":"/audio/aeeebeeec713d101b879.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"축구팀이","meaning":"足球；队","explanation":"축구：足球；팀：队；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"},{"term":"팀","audio":"/audio/321639b7ad86dc7655c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"20274","senseId":"2","lemma":"팀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구팀이","audio":"/audio/2accc28148a8bc4cfa6a.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"못했어.","meaning":"不如，逊色","explanation":"못하다：不如，逊色；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬