ation":"팀：队","readings":[{"term":"팀","audio":"/audio/321639b7ad86dc7655c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20274","senseId":"2","lemma":"팀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팀","audio":"/audio/321639b7ad86dc7655c3.mp3"}},{"text":"골문","meaning":"球门","explanation":"골문：球门","readings":[{"term":"골문","audio":"/audio/9c14271ddb9527bd015d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18318","senseId":"1","lemma":"골문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"골문","audio":"/audio/9c14271ddb9527bd015d.mp3"}},{"text":"안으로","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안으로","audio":"/audio/f58e9a42177825301954.mp3"}},{"text":"공이","meaning":"球","explanation":"공：球；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19496","senseId":"1","lemma":"공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공이","audio":"/audio/3d187fca49d07b4aec0f.mp3"}},{"text":"들어갈","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어갈","audio":"/audio/8e2d25fce03474b34354.mp3"}},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때마다","audio":"/audio/1e35b901eccff392fa42.mp3"}},{"text":"탄식이","meaning":"叹息，叹气","explanation":"탄식：叹息，叹气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"탄식","audio":"/audio/1ec16a66a014203ed7f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81453","sen